---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Low Testosterone & ED Rx for Men — My4MLife';
const description = 'Telemedicine TRT consult + hormone panel. One consult fee, potentially two scripts (testosterone + ED). For men. $249.';
const canonical = 'https://www.my4mlife.com/rx/testosterone-ed';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical}>

<section class="rx-section">
  <div class="container rx-inner">
    <p class="rx-eyebrow">For Men · Low Testosterone &amp; Erectile Dysfunction</p>
    <h1>Low Testosterone. Erectile Dysfunction. One consult. Two possible scripts.</h1>

    <p class="rx-lead">
      Low testosterone and erectile dysfunction travel together. They share the same upstream drivers — declining hormones, endothelial dysfunction, sleep debt, visceral fat. Treating one without evaluating the other leaves the bigger problem in place.
    </p>

    <p class="rx-body">
      Your telemedicine TRT consult includes a comprehensive hormone panel (total + free testosterone, estradiol, SHBG, fasting glucose, HbA1c, lipids, hsCRP, TSH). Based on the panel, the physician can write for testosterone replacement, a PDE5 inhibitor (sildenafil or tadalafil), or both — at the same visit. <strong>One consult fee. Two potential scripts.</strong> ED is the canary in the coal mine for hormones, cardiovascular health, and cognitive trajectory — addressing both at once is how you treat the system, not just the symptom.
    </p>

    <p class="rx-price-line">
      <strong>$249</strong> — telemedicine TRT consult + mandatory hormone panel (required for any testosterone prescription).
      <span class="rx-pay-note">Medication is billed separately after the physician writes your script(s).</span>
    </p>

    <a class="rx-cta-btn" href="/rx/testosterone-ed/questionnaire">
      Start Your Health Questionnaire &rarr;
    </a>

    <p class="rx-disclosure">
      Complete a brief health questionnaire and save your payment method. Our care coordinator will email you within 24 hours to confirm next steps with the network physician.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
.rx-section { padding: calc(76px + 3.5rem) 1rem 5rem; min-height: 60vh; }
.rx-inner { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 1.25rem; }
.rx-eyebrow { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0; }
.rx-inner h1 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.6vw, 2.4rem); color: var(--primary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.18; max-width: 640px; }
.rx-lead { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0.5rem 0 0; max-width: 640px; }
.rx-body { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.62; margin: 0; max-width: 640px; }
.rx-body strong { color: var(--accent); }
.rx-price-line { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--primary); margin: 0.5rem 0 0; max-width: 640px; line-height: 1.55; }
.rx-price-line strong { color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.35rem; }
.rx-pay-note { display: block; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-light); font-style: italic; margin-top: 0.35rem; }
.rx-cta-btn { display: inline-block; background: var(--accent); color: #fff; padding: 1rem 2.2rem; border-radius: 999px; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; border: none; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 1rem; box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,184,148,0.25); transition: opacity .15s; text-decoration: none; }
.rx-cta-btn:hover { opacity: 0.92; }
.rx-disclosure { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-light); margin: 0.5rem 0 0; max-width: 560px; line-height: 1.5; }
</style>
